    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nForkin Property are delighted to present Glenbrook, a substantial four-bedroom detached home on a generous 0.21-acre site just moments from Wicklow Town centre. Offering over 164 sq.m of well-balanced accommodation along with numerous outbuildings, this property presents exceptional potential for residential, mixed-use, or commercial redevelopment given its prominent Marlton Road frontage. A rare opportunity in a prime central location.\n\nGlenbrook represents a very rare opportunity for a purchaser to acquire a spacious, modern, detached home with a large garden site with huge future planning potential. Given the property's location so close to Wicklow Town centre and over 36 metres of road frontage on to Marlton Road, Glenbrook may also appeal to buyers seeking a central commercial premises. \n\nThe house could easily be converted to offices, healthcare facility etc. Alternatively the property could be changed to a mixed-use with the house as is and converting the numerous outbuildings to commercial use. \n\nGround floor accommodation briefly comprises; entrance hall, living room with feature fireplace, study, sitting room with feature fireplace and large wood burning stove, fully fitted kitchen, lounge, utility room and guest WC. On the first floor is the good sized landing off which is the full family bathroom, hot press and 4 double bedrooms with master ensuite bathroom and walk-in wardrobe. There is a pull-down Stira staircase on the landing leading to a very spacious, fully floored, full height attic space that could easily be converted to further accommodation with minimal disruption. \n\nThe property is entered off the Marlton Road through double gates on to a concrete yard area. To the right there are 3 block built stores/sheds all with galvanised roofs, a 3 bay stable block and steel hayshed. The house is located to the left with a sunny front patio. Off the kitchen is an enclosed side patio area. To the back and side is concrete passageway.\n\nGlenbrook located less than a minutes walk from Abbey Street and Wicklow Town centre with close proximity to all services and amenities including creches, numerous primary and secondary schools, shops, restaurants, sports and leisure facilities and transport networks including the N11/M11 motorway, frequent bus service to Dublin and Wicklow Train Station. One of the main bus stops for the town is located directly opposite the house. Viewing of this fine property is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Well presented 4 bedroom family home</li><li> Over 164 sq.m (1,765 sq.ft) of accommodation</li><li> Centrally located close to Wicklow Town Centre</li><li> Large, in town site of circa 0.21 acres</li><li> Oil fired central heating</li><li> Double glazing throughout</li><li> Easily converted attic space</li><li> Assortment of outbuildings</li><li> Excellent future development potential subject to planning permission</li><li> Currently zoned Town Centre (TC)</li><li> Over 36 metres of frontage on to Marlton Road</li><li> Could be changed to commercial or mixed-use</ul>"
      },
